OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended in some
OL,4,Aparts of Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Republic of Ireland's water
OL,7,Fsupplier is extending a hosepipe ban in
OL,8,F13 counties on Wednesday but lifting it
OL,9,Fin the rest of the country.
OL,11,FUisce Eireann's (formerly Irish Water)
OL,12,Fsaid it can lift the ban in counties
OL,13,Fincluding Donegal and Sligo due to "an
OL,14,Fimprovement in the availability of
OL,15,Fwater for supply and increased
OL,16,Frainfall".
OL,18,FBut in counties where the ban is being
OL,19,Fextended - including Dublin and Wicklow
OL,20,F- the public is being asked to continue
OL,21,Fto avoid non-essential water use until
OL,22,Fthe end of September.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
