OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended in some
OL,4,Aparts of Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Supplies in parts of the east and
OL,7,Fsouth remain under pressure, and water
OL,8,Fsources in these areas will need more
OL,9,Ftime to recover," Margaret Attridge of
OL,10,FUisce Eireann said.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
